==Description==
'''Cool Ducky''', internally referred to as '''Cool Ducky Trick''', is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Ducky Revenge Event]]. It is obtained from Level 5 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|120}} or {{Robux|140}} ({{Robux|119}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|370}} or {{Robux|280}} ({{Robux|236}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Cool Ducky''' showcases the [[Cool Ducky (Ducky Revenge)|Cool Ducky]] enemy performing a kick flip mid air. It plays a quacking sound followed by skateboard sounds when used.

==Trivia==
*'''Cool Ducky''' was given out as a physical sticker by the developers during the Roblox Developer Conference 2025.

